+### Comment moderation
+
+Post owners can open a moderation queue from the profile page to review the
+comments left on their own posts. Each comment carries a moderation status. The
+queue can be filtered by one of the following statuses:
+
+- `pending`
+- `approved`
+- `rejected`
+
+The owner can select any number of comments in the queue and remove them in one
+action.
+
 ### Simple usage instructions
 
 1. Click `profile` icon at footer > signup > enter email and password > changes to login modal > enter email and password used to signup
